    "id": "potential-moire",
    "title": "Potential Moiré",
    "description": [
"The <i>Potential Moiré</i> series extends an ongoing investigation of interference into an installation-based format. Rather than presenting moiré as a self-contained object, these works suspend single acrylic sheets within prepared environments, generating optical interference through spatial relationships and viewer movement.",
"While interaction is currently limited to spatial movement, the work points toward future iterations featuring modular components built for physical manipulation. Shaped by bodily engagement and discovery, these interactive moments invite viewers to actively participate in shaping the visual experience."    ],
